 "description": "Eaton Rack PDU G4, metered input, 0U: a 1730 mm black aluminium strip that hangs on two mounting buttons in a rack's vertical channel and hands a three-phase 120/208 V wye feed (a fixed 10 ft cord with a NEMA L21-30P plug, 24 A, 8.6 kW) on to 42 outlets - 24 IEC C13 and 18 Eaton C39 - in six colour-coded sections of seven. Three 20 A two-pole breakers, A, B and C, each line to line, each feed two sections. A hot-swappable network module with two gigabit Ethernet ports, a pixel LCD and four keys sits between the two halves.",
 "format": 1,
